# ANANKE Native Quantum Script
# Testing Grover's Search Algorithm to amplify a hidden marked database item
qubits 2

# Step 1: Put all database elements into an equal superposition state
gate H 0
gate H 1

# Step 2: Query the hidden search oracle (marks target state |11> with a phase flip)
oracle search

# Step 3: Run the standalone Diffusion Operator to amplify the marked state's amplitude
diffusion

# The state vector should now cleanly show the target state |11> amplified to 100%
measure
